        <div class="hero-product__main">
            {{> c-rating custom="Backed by Dermatologists" light=true }}
            <p>ANTI-AGING &amp; ALL-IN-ONE SERUM</p>
            <h1>Embrace ageless confidence with All-In-One Face Serum</h1>
            <article>
                <ul>
                    <li>Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and uneven skin tone, for smoother-, firmer-looking skin.</li>
                    <li>Save money buying multiple skincare products to treat various concerns.</li>
                    <li>Argireline® Peptides, Retinol, Bakuchiol, Niacinamide, Vitamin C, Vitamin E, Ferulic Acid.</li>
