                        "summary": "Key Benefits",
                        "text": "
                            <p>The All-In-One Serum helps improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven skin tone, dryness, and rough texture in one simple step. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>
                            <p>Visible benefits may include:</p>
