                                <li>Brighter, more radiant-looking skin</li>
                                <li>Smoother- and softer-looking skin texture</li>
                                <li>Improved appearance of uneven skin tone and discoloration</li>
                                <li>Reduced appearance of fine lines and early signs of aging</li>
                                <li>Hydrated, refreshed, and healthier-looking skin</li>
